Covered files
-------------

    pack/casebank/cases/*.json

These eight case files are a derived database: each combines, for one TCGA-LUAD
patient, (a) pathology report text and clinical fields from the NCI Genomic
Data Commons open-access tier and (b) molecular alteration data from the
cBioPortal for Cancer Genomics public API (study `luad_tcga`), restructured
into this pack's case schema by `ingest_tcga_lung.py`.

